Package: koine
Title: Synthesised Fourth Opinion for Bayesian Triangulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Max",
    family = "Moldovan",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Synthesises one coherent, independent predictive opinion for a
    Bayesian model from a curated battery of known and underutilised inference
    methods, or abstains when no diversity gain exists. Built to serve as a
    fourth, synthesised witness alongside an independent panel of inference
    engines: it stacks over model-structure and method diversity in predictive
    space (leave-one-out stacking, PSIS-gated) on an axis orthogonal to the
    engine axis, never averaging the engines. Predictive opinions are exchanged
    through an ArviZ-style 'DataTree' 'NetCDF' interchange so no live 'Python'
    is required at read time. Abstention is a first-class, honest outcome.
URL: https://github.com/max578/koine
